  "ne30:0.4": "3. 2. 11. paññattihārasampāto ",
  "ne30:1.1": "tattha katamo paññatti hārasampāto: ",
  "ne30:2.1": "“tasmā rakkhitacitta’ssa sammāsaṅkappagocaroti”ti gāthā. ",
  "ne30:2.2": "“tasmā rakkhitacitta’ssāti padaṭṭhānapaññatti satiyā; ",
  "ne30:2.3": "sammāsaṅkappagocaro”ti bhāvanāpaññatti samathassa; ",
  "ne30:2.4": "“sammādiṭṭhi purekkhāro ñatvāna udabbaya”ntī dassanabhūmiyā nikkhepapaññatti; ",
  "ne30:2.5": "“thīnamuddhābhibhū bhikkhū”ti samudayassa anavasesapahāna paññatti; “sabbā duggatiyo jahe”ti bhāvanāpaññatti maggassa. ",
  "ne30:2.6": "niyutto paññattihārasampāto "
}
